{"id": "q0023", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4294256, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Skyler has 100 hats on his hand with the colors red, blue, and white. Half of the hats are red, 3/5 of the remaining hats are blue, and the rest are white. How many white hats does Skyler have?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0023.wav", "input_sha256": "57b96041cbcd1aea8251057468152525f1e69c7067b08783b18550b8a4009bbd", "input_samples": 256800, "input_s": 16.05, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.134, "act": 0.9983, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we know that half of the hats are red, so that's 50. The remaining hats are blue and white, which means there are 50 hats left. Three- fifths of those are blue, so three-fifths of 5 0 is 3 0. That leaves us with 2 0 hats that are white.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 16, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 15, "feed_lag_max_ms": 59, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 59, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0023_local_local.wav", "sha256": "735e8826ec8a26f3d2e374215f0f2f1d0c802471e8b13a91dd6a1294eb718da9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 14.6}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.061, 1.107, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.058, 2.103, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.061, 3.108, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.058, 4.107, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.06, 5.108, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.059, 6.109, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.059, 7.108, 1, 0