{"id": "q0212", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1609511243, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "Using the definition of the unilateral Z transform, F (z) = ^\\infty\\sum_n=0 f[n] z^-n. find the z - transform of the step-sequence f[n] = u[n].\n\nA. [1 / (z - 1)]\nB. [z / (1 + z)]\nC. [z^2 / (z - 1)]\nD. [1 / (2 - z)]\nE. [(z - 1) / z]\nF. [1 / (z^2 - 1)]\nG. [1 / (1 - z)]\nH. [z / (1 - z)]\nI. [z / (z - 1)]\nJ. [z / (z^2 - 1)]\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0212.wav", "input_sha256": "cb0c43215556db43fa36a18e812d62c788eedc36caf1f0b4e579a75b19d2a79a", "input_samples": 383600, "input_s": 23.975, "n_real_chunks": 24, "score": 0.8367, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The step sequence is defined as f of n equal s u of n, which is 1 for all n greater than or equal to zero. So when we plug this into the unilateral Z transform formula, we get the sum from n equals zero to infinity of z to the minus n. This is a geometric series with ratio z to the minus one. So applying the formula for an infinite geometric series, it's one divided by one minus z to the minus one, which simpl ifies to one over one minus z to the minus one. That matches option E.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 24, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 31, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0