{"id": "q0497", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3822138238, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "提供三个市场营销活动的想法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0497.wav", "input_sha256": "2f39f9713ae0de2999899f625e5634b101feac7d7d12971e9ce00e43b2e7e4a3", "input_samples": 48000, "input_s": 3.0, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.2639, "act": 0.9986, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "可以为你的品牌策划一个社交媒体活动，鼓励用户分享他们使用产品或服务的照片或视频。这样不仅能增加互动，还能让更多人知道你的品牌。第二个想法是举办一场限时优惠活动，比如在特定日期推出折扣或赠品，吸引消费者赶在截止日期前购买。最后一个建议是组织一次线下体验活动，例如快闪店或互动工作坊，让顾客亲身体验产品，增强品牌记忆点。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 36, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0497_local_local.wav", "sha256": "4f7138866f06de27e4c824157c4e58828e0b3ca1ba25e33fa18542430ed7f07d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 36.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.06, 1.106, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.062, 2.109, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.062, 3.107, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 4.0, 4.058, 4.569, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 5.0, 5.06, 5.584, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 6.0, 6.059, 6.604, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 7.0, 7.064, 7.635, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 8.0, 8.059, 8.609, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 9.0, 9.058, 9.599, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 10.0, 10.06, 10.603, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 11.0, 11.063, 11.588, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 12.0, 12.065, 12.566, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 13.0, 13.062, 13.58, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 14.0, 14.062, 14.631, 0, 24000, 0], [