{"id": "q0517", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 717935425, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "清洁白板的步骤：", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0517.wav", "input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "input_samples": 24600, "input_s": 1.538, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.3902, "act": 0.9868, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "首先用湿布或干布把白板表面的灰尘和碎屑擦掉。然后喷上专用的白板清洁剂，不要过量，以免流到地面。接着用干净的微纤维布轻轻打圈擦拭，避免用力过猛划伤表面。如果有顽固污渍，可以用棉签蘸点清洁剂小心清理。最后用干布再擦一遍，确保不留水迹或残留物。记得定期清洁，保持白板清晰易写。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 29, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_local_local.wav", "sha256": "4fc41dbd9180e5e42f7a00d32fc91e7fea83e3f8d2c194ffb981fe7ed469d493", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 28.68}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.061, 1.108, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.538, 1.597, 1.642, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.538, 2.595, 2.64, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.599, 4.155, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.599, 5.16, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.599, 6.182, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.598, 7.236, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.598, 8.087, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.598, 9.159, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.602, 10.247, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.597, 11.088, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.599, 12.147, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.537, 12.599, 13.158, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.537, 13.599, 14.13, 0, 24000, 0], [14,